{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "347788fffb9869c82507f962e115234f329af96c024627f7fa85118e71164f9a", "ja": "ふう……こんなところかな。\nうん！　ピッカピカになった！", "zh": "呼……差不多就是这样吧。\n嗯！擦得锃光瓦亮了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6869e999a2ad4a703643365124024af8dba8487650121ea6b2cbe39a4b7fe78c", "ja": "あれ、のり子？　こんなところで何して……。\nもしかして、バイクの洗車か？", "zh": "咦，诺莉子？你在这种地方做什么……  \n难道是在洗摩托车吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "88c5a3040d16fc6f9a6aa0fad782c2e04aa22c437a55133bbddab506bb8511bd", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　お疲れさま。\nそうだよ、クラウザー号を洗車してたとこ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！辛苦了。\n是啊，我刚才正在给克劳泽号洗车呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "df4d9c9d0734936f72625339da83204f2c5d464c066d8a59225668db9492d8c3", "ja": "天気よくて洗車日和だし、この前のツーリングの後、\n洗ってあげられてなかったからね。", "zh": "天气这么好，正适合洗车，而且上次骑车兜风之后，\n都还没来得及给它洗呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "baaacc715be0abd72918ac13f74e8c722aff8e825408359571ccbd2c39f565aa", "ja": "長距離乗った後は、必ず洗車してるんだ。\nアタシを乗せてくれて、ありがとねーって。", "zh": "骑完长途后，我一定会洗车的。毕竟它载着我，也得跟它说声谢谢嘛——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e91cb0776ec7afccddc0dc2d1e9b7b329f3f789a767d847c1ac30236463d22ed", "ja": "そうか……のり子はバイクを大事にしてるんだな。\nこのバイクは、結構乗ってるのか？", "zh": "这样啊……原来你很爱惜这辆摩托车啊。\n这辆摩托车，你骑了很久了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "3aafaf29e5a4298447ef8dfc4019dac3f1d38c430509deb51971ff9d8dff7ef8", "ja": "う～ん、そうだね。\n一緒に走った距離は、そこそこあるかな？", "zh": "嗯～，是啊。一起骑过的路程，应该也算不少吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "5cad314d4520841e324538139e36579628fbd1ca195bb7c8c20375df18db9f7b", "ja": "アタシの無茶に付き合わせてるから、愛着もあるし。\nまだまだ大事に乗っていきたいってとこ♪", "zh": "因为总是拉着它陪我胡来，所以也很有感情了。\n今后还想继续好好爱护它，一直骑下去♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1008_p", "source_sha256": "55c36298952416dac65002bbcbd327dfdfdaa3cff2ee930f1ddc078e8e4cd331", "ja": "本当に相棒って感じなんだな。\nのり子にとって。", "zh": "真的就像是搭档一样啊。\n对你来说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "1b3da80b10ea6d4c387c38d6a72fcc318ced0cdc155ca6d3dbf6baa6be8860bb", "ja": "うん。ずっとアタシの成長を見守ってくれて、\nいろんな景色を見せてくれた、かけがえのない相棒！", "zh": "嗯。它一直见证着我的成长，\n带我领略了各种各样的风景，是我无可替代的搭档！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "6e654aa6cab98b4b5f1d42d269f97d788d9eea34cf9f9ac690beec40cc267154", "ja": "それってなんか、ちょっと……似てるかもね？\nアタシと{$P$}に……。", "zh": "总觉得有点……像呢？\n我和{$P$}……也许有点像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "660d4eb6cd7ed11833f59a00c97c2f80246e952a91b411f755b45b97b8934e0d", "ja": "アタシをいろんな場所に連れていってくれて、\nいろんな景色を見せてくれた……。", "zh": "带我去过许多地方，\n让我看到了各种各样的风景……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "91b0ebf70d921fb204904335c1e7e44a769a33addd2de1b758b4a86bf48a1e53", "ja": "なにより、クラウザー号も{$P$}も、\nアタシを乗せるのがうまいしね！", "zh": "最重要的是，克劳泽号和{$P$}都很会载我嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c6e3e60dc78c71ebd895abead2ae35939a09660fc33a7eac17c3aa4f66204056", "ja": "はは、それは言い得て妙だな。けど俺は、\nのり子を乗せてるわけじゃない。本心だからな！", "zh": "哈哈，这个说法还真贴切。不过，我可不是在故意捧你，是真心话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "29dac231ce1ff052a235171c877c782eaf6e07c901d9114254b0a077863bf31d", "ja": "もう、そういうところだってば！　……でも、\n頼りにしてるよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "真是的，就是说你这种地方啦！……不过，\n我也很信赖你哦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1015_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "7bf468b5039b70092e87d7066c37a3cb03e51db76116d9436e2eaeab258aaf22", "ja": "もうすぐ出番だね。すごい、盛り上がってるなぁ。\nううっ、なんかいつもより緊張してるかも……。", "zh": "马上就该上场了呢。好厉害，气氛真热烈啊。\n呜呜，总觉得好像比平时更紧张了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7d7a4b1772af975aa40d6181d48a97b8a32a50fb36122484c1d4d48975b79107", "ja": "そうなのか？　最近ののり子にしては、珍しいな。\n普段通りにやれば大丈夫だぞ。", "zh": "是这样吗？对最近的典子来说，还真少见啊。\n照平时那样做就没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "b2430cd34b1260af79a87b6981370104dbeaeee97f9d3e78b6a050577d9f6960", "ja": "う、うん。けど今回は、新衣装での\n初ステージ、いわばデビュー戦だから……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。不过这次可是穿着新服装的首次舞台，也可以说是出道战，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "06cb23de08e5c5c76aa1fad1dd53a69738fa5077f0839a639036edea256c5d1d", "ja": "せっかくの新しい衣装なのに、アタシが失敗したら\nケチがついちゃう。そんなの悪いし……。", "zh": "难得穿上新衣服，要是我搞砸了，可就给它蒙上污点了。那样不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fe3fe89a3f4b10a92a4984f039abec4a37d2cc4deb7a45e7c66fc67348c9984e", "ja": "そんな事は、気にしなくて大丈夫だ。失敗しても\nのり子のせいでも、衣装のせいでもない。次もある。", "zh": "不用在意这些。就算失败了，也不是你的错，也不是服装的错。还有下一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1021_p", "source_sha256": "15d35be104a72c0d6560826182e7993706d0a09fd37823eb9997197bfe591539", "ja": "何より、この衣装はのり子にバッチリ似合ってる。\n俺が保証するから、安心して楽しんでこい！", "zh": "最重要的是，这套服装非常适合诺丽子。\n我来保证，你就放心去享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "fd34bd39616d7867d7dace612232d5e2264be357790baf4256f3a583a026f5cc", "ja": "{$P$}……ホント、アタシを\n乗せるのがうまいよね。でも、わかった！", "zh": "{$P$}……你真的很会哄我开心呢。不过，我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0204_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "9db070065241aaedea71816ca1b85c9873dd9df23ff821eb0403974f79ee5959", "ja": "その言葉、信じるよ。思いっきり盛り上げてくる！\n……いってきます！", "zh": "我相信你这句话。我会尽全力把气氛炒热的！\n……我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
